  "summary": "Compact semantic delta envelopes for bandwidth-constrained links. Queue messages and forward after connectivity resumes. Boundaries: Nested packages and scoped instructions are not exhaustively inventoried. Research prototype; the README quickstart uses simulated transport and does not establish live radio operation in this mission.",
